{
 "title": "Firmware upgrade For U1_U2",
 "html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">For Board Version: U1 / U2</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It is highly recommended to back up your <strong>&#8220;CD KEY&#8221;</strong> before proceeding with the update. You can find it under <strong>&#8220;Settings -&gt; System.&#8221;</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There are two ways to update:</p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Firmware Only Update:</strong> This method will not clear your settings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Full Erase &amp; Rewrite:</strong> This method will clear all settings, including the device&#8217;s <strong>&#8220;CD KEY.&#8221;</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Even if you choose the <strong>Firmware Only Update</strong> method, you <strong>must</strong> back up your &#8220;CD KEY.&#8221; Unexpected issues—such as update failures, power outages, or accidental drops—can occur. A lost &#8220;CD KEY&#8221; is <strong>unrecoverable</strong>; however, if you have a backup, you can use the &#8220;Full Erase &amp; Rewrite&#8221; method to restore your device if something goes wrong.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The first method is generally recommended. If you choose &#8220;Full Erase &amp; Rewrite,&#8221; you will need to connect to Wi-Fi, access the web management interface, navigate to <strong>&#8220;Settings -&gt; System,&#8221;</strong> enter your <strong>&#8220;CD KEY,&#8221;</strong> save, and restart the device.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>U1 / U2 Online Update (Firmware Only):</strong> [<a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/u_touch_update_init/update_firmware\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a>]</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>U1 Online Full Erase &amp; Rewrite:</strong> [<a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/u_touch_update_init/u1_init\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a>] <a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/u1_update_init/init\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">(</a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">Not recommended</mark><a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/u1_update_init/init\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">)</a><br><strong>U2 Online Full Erase &amp; Rewrite:</strong> [<a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/u_touch_update_init/u2_init\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a>]<a href=\"https://www.bitdsk.org/u1_update_init/init\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">(</a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-red-color\">Not recommended</mark>)</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-stripes\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th>Time(M.D.Y)</th><th>Version</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>04.18.2026</td><td>V_1.5.2</td><td>1.Fixed a memory error.<br><br>2.Fixed an issue where some coins were not displaying prices.<br><br>3.Fixed an issue where the candlestick chart only displayed BTC prices.<br><br>4.Optimized the message queue.<br><br>5.Modified the weather retrieval logic.<br><br>6.Reduced screen sensitivity to prevent accidental triggering caused by screen aging.<br><br>7.Fixed an issue where setting the coin to BTC in the background would result in it displaying as BTCUSDT after restarting.<br><br>8.Added the ability to switch between screen fixation and polling.</td></tr><tr><td>04.09.2026</td><td>V_1.5.1</td><td>Optimize the display of UI elements.</td></tr><tr><td>04.09.2026</td><td>V_1.5</td><td>1.Fixed string issues<br>2.Added support for ckpool<br>3.Adding bg.bin only applies to the first screen or all screens.</td></tr><tr><td>04.07.2026</td><td>V_1.4</td><td>Add custom UI functionality</td></tr><tr><td>03.28.2026</td><td>V_1.2</td><td>1.Fixed backend page errors<br><br>2.Modified the method for obtaining hashrate<br><br>3.Modified the style of the Wi-Fi settings page<br><br>4.Added screen prompts, such as: Connecting, Reconnecting after disconnection<br><br>5.Fixed the issue of Wi-Fi names not containing spaces in the Wi-Fi settings interface<br><br>6.Modified screen initialization logic</td></tr><tr><td>&#8211;</td><td>V_1.0</td><td>Default</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
